,"shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BMFEcats-nV5fjwm2kCHCQ","review_id":"hffC19iMPYy0Gy2_9hYLsw","date":"2014-04-18T03:28:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9183536171913147,"text_excerpt":"The typical convenience store with po boy counter in the back. Don't take the \"fine foods\" part literally. The prices are cheap, the food is consistent, the workers friendly, and it's the best food place, in point (ish), in my opinion. You can also get the full 32 inch loaf, which is nice. Not something to come out of your way for, but I'm glad it's in the neighborhood! Since they don't have it listed on Yelp, the kitchen closes at 6:30."},{"business_id":"BMFEcats-nV5fjwm2kCHCQ","review_id":"rp5lJ__gHBXkHA_zVeE6-A","date":"2017-08-15T19:56:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9095414876937866,"text_excerpt":"A convenience store that offers a variety of Merchandise. The people who work there are friendly. In the back, there is a sandwich counter that sells some very tasty po-boys at excellent prices. I am very fond of the roast beef. Yummy!"},{"business_id":"BMFEcats-nV5fjwm2kCHCQ","review_id":"6uMycoKWXagGrhcOiPdXFw","date":"2015-08-13T00:40:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8938498497009277,"text_excerpt":"Went in here today for a quick lunch. I bought a catfish sandwich on a bun and a Gatorade, cost: $5.21 including tax. That was an incredible bargain. They aren't small sandwiches, and the sandwich itself was $3.19. It's a steal, and what's more- it was dang tasty! I'll definitely go back for lunch, many more times :)"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
